ch08/58-df-zfc-set-countable-support.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9CountableSupportFunction}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet9CountableSupportFunction}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（本原子的兼容谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}countable\\text{-}support\\text{-}function}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet9CountableSupportFunction}_S(f,0)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcSetCountableSupport}_S(f,0)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}countable\\text{-}support\\text{-}function}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet9CountableSupportFunction}_S(f,0)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcSetCountableSupport}_S(f,0)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>零元必须作为参数显式给出；不同陪域或不同指定零元会产生不同支撑。</li>\n<li>上游谓词同时要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 是函数，并要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\ne0\\}\">\\(\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\ne0\\}\\)</span> 是可数集。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-set-countable-support.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbb965a5bc7958bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-set-countable-support.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-set-countable-support.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbb965a5bc7958bc","anchor":"ref-3","t